{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11567","headline":"暮春题瀼西新赁草屋五首 三 · 杜甫","name":"暮春题瀼西新赁草屋五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩云阴复白，锦树晓来青。\n身世双蓬鬓，乾坤一草亭。\n哀歌时自短，醉舞爲谁醒。\n细雨荷锄立，江猨吟翠屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}